# Diverging Ram Inlet (DRI) CFD Test Runs

This directory (`runs/dri_tests`) contains OpenFOAM CFD test cases for diverging duct geometries and Diverging Ram Inlet (DRI) module tests.

## 🛠️ Configuration & Setup

* **Solver:** `rhoCentralFoam`
* **Flow Type:** 2D Planar
* **Viscosity:** Inviscid

## WARNING

These are not fully converged. We don't do that becuase it would just confirm failures we're moving away from.